 ## Unreleased
 
 - `Schedule.cancel(appointment_id)` marks an appointment as cancelled. It stays on record and no longer blocks its slot.
+- `Schedule.is_fully_booked(therapist, day)` is true when a therapist has reached the 7-treatment daily cap. For the online booking page only; `book()` does not enforce the cap.
 
